WEBVTT

00:11.136 --> 00:12.387
My name is

00:13.471 --> 00:14.931
Kim Mi-jeong.

00:19.436 --> 00:21.563
I impersonated Sarah Kim.

00:22.522 --> 00:24.858
I killed her to become Sarah Kim.

00:27.652 --> 00:29.112
What did you just say?

00:29.612 --> 00:30.655
My name is…

00:32.407 --> 00:33.825
Kim Mi-jeong.

00:35.118 --> 00:37.120
Did she just say she's Kim Mi-jeong?

00:37.203 --> 00:38.163
Not Sarah Kim?

00:38.246 --> 00:40.498
No, but she's definitely Sarah Kim.

00:41.041 --> 00:41.875
She is.

00:44.335 --> 00:47.464
I've been impersonating Sarah Kim
and deceiving you all this time.

00:48.840 --> 00:52.802
It was to obtain official recognition
as Sarah Kim by an investigative agency.

00:53.386 --> 00:56.347
I disfigured her face
and threw her in the sewer

00:56.890 --> 00:58.683
so that she'd die as me,

00:59.184 --> 01:01.936
and I would live as Sarah Kim.

01:03.772 --> 01:05.732
I admit my wrongdoings

01:05.815 --> 01:08.151
and readily accept the due punishment.

01:09.611 --> 01:11.154
But I'm not sorry.

01:14.741 --> 01:15.992
For that, I'm sorry.

01:26.795 --> 01:28.379
Is it because of Boudoir?

01:28.463 --> 01:31.341
She and the victim are indistinguishable.
She's exploiting that.

01:31.841 --> 01:34.219
If Sarah Kim is an innocent murder victim,

01:34.719 --> 01:37.847
the Boudoir fraud case will be closed
due to a lack of authority.

01:40.225 --> 01:43.061
The key is to prove her identity,
not the murder.

01:43.144 --> 01:44.979
Why are you giving up everything

01:46.314 --> 01:48.399
just to save one thing?

01:56.741 --> 02:00.161
Anyone linked to the case will know
that's a lie just by looking at you.

02:00.829 --> 02:04.207
If that was your plan,
you should've come in with a smashed face!

02:04.290 --> 02:06.334
Why? Couldn't you bear to do that?

02:06.417 --> 02:08.503
Then why'd you do it to the victim?

02:08.586 --> 02:09.546
Detective.

02:10.255 --> 02:13.007
Some people are better off dead.

02:14.300 --> 02:16.678
Sarah Kim was that kind of person.

02:17.512 --> 02:19.055
To those who knew her

02:19.597 --> 02:20.765
and to me too.

02:21.891 --> 02:24.644
Nobody would want Sarah Kim alive.

02:28.398 --> 02:30.024
You've taken action.

02:30.900 --> 02:32.527
I only relayed news of her death.

02:35.113 --> 02:36.990
Let me make a call.

02:38.491 --> 02:39.534
Hello?

02:41.870 --> 02:42.745
Hello?

02:49.502 --> 02:50.837
Why'd you call?

02:51.880 --> 02:53.548
With Sarah Kim's death,

02:53.631 --> 02:57.135
Nox has control of Boudoir
as the top shareholder.

03:07.604 --> 03:09.397
That doesn't change anything.

03:10.565 --> 03:14.068
You are Sarah Kim,
and you killed Kim Mi-jeong.

03:14.569 --> 03:16.196
You can't prove that.

03:16.696 --> 03:19.199
You donated a kidney in the past.

03:21.659 --> 03:25.997
Luckily, the hospital
still had your tissue sample in storage.

03:31.169 --> 03:34.464
By now, our detectives will have arrived
at the hospital.

03:35.548 --> 03:36.883
I'll go.

03:37.383 --> 03:39.219
We have one hour left now.

03:43.139 --> 03:45.225
I win if the call comes in by then.

03:46.643 --> 03:48.228
If not, you do.

03:51.272 --> 03:52.440
INTERROGATION IN PROGRESS

04:06.246 --> 04:07.705
But you know, Detective,

04:08.873 --> 04:10.750
I confessed,

04:10.833 --> 04:12.877
but I haven't told you everything.

04:14.254 --> 04:18.758
I haven't told you
how I killed her and disposed of her.

04:23.388 --> 04:27.642
I can tell you
the story you want to hear now.

04:28.226 --> 04:31.020
So tell them to stop wasting time
and come back.

04:31.521 --> 04:34.315
No. I already know the full story.

04:34.399 --> 04:38.695
- Only as circumstances and speculations.
- What if they're plausible ones?

04:40.446 --> 04:41.823
Would you like to hear them?

04:44.742 --> 04:45.702
That day,

04:46.703 --> 04:48.579
it snowed heavily.

05:02.593 --> 05:06.514
That day was the celebration
of Boudoir's new collection,

05:07.015 --> 05:09.642
but it was also the day of its downfall.

05:11.227 --> 05:14.522
Because everyone who despised you
was at the event.

05:26.993 --> 05:30.163
Did you start without me, Sarah?

05:32.290 --> 05:33.875
I didn't think you'd come.

05:34.667 --> 05:36.294
We should finish our talk.

05:38.504 --> 05:43.760
Jeong Yeo-jin stated that she spoke to you
as the after-party began.

05:47.472 --> 05:51.059
That was only the beginning
of what was to come.

05:51.851 --> 05:54.187
Because misfortunes never come singly.

06:08.785 --> 06:12.413
Choi Chae-u arrived at the Boudoir party
around 22:40.

06:12.914 --> 06:15.541
She said she had attended the party alone,

06:15.625 --> 06:17.043
but that wasn't true.

06:17.543 --> 06:19.045
She had company.

06:19.796 --> 06:21.464
Find Sarah Kim.

06:21.964 --> 06:22.799
Yes, ma'am.

06:22.882 --> 06:24.801
I wonder why she hid that from me.

06:26.260 --> 06:31.140
Choi Chae-u said she wasn't aware
of your relationship with Kang Ji-hwon.

06:32.225 --> 06:34.352
But in fact, she knew.

06:44.862 --> 06:47.740
You had to get impatient
and make a mess of things.

06:49.325 --> 06:52.245
I'll return your investment tomorrow,
so leave quietly.

06:54.122 --> 06:56.040
And don't get any stupid ideas.

06:57.083 --> 06:58.960
I can hire people too.

07:01.087 --> 07:03.631
I just met someone interesting.

07:04.465 --> 07:05.299
Who?

07:05.383 --> 07:08.428
An Oxford graduate
who's a private equity manager.

07:08.511 --> 07:09.679
Don't freak out.

07:09.762 --> 07:12.473
They graduated in the same year
with the same major as you.

07:12.557 --> 07:13.683
Isn't that wild?

07:15.476 --> 07:19.856
I wasn't a diligent student,
so they probably don't know me.

07:20.356 --> 07:22.275
No, they remember you.

07:23.151 --> 07:24.152
They do?

07:24.235 --> 07:25.069
Yes.

07:25.153 --> 07:29.115
They said you stood out as special,
even among them.

07:30.575 --> 07:32.493
I have a lot to attend to now.

07:32.577 --> 07:33.619
Maybe next time.

07:33.703 --> 07:35.746
It'll only take a moment.

07:58.478 --> 08:00.938
When did you become an Oxford graduate?

08:05.234 --> 08:06.569
When did you start?

08:08.237 --> 08:09.155
Start what?

08:13.159 --> 08:14.952
Conning me.

08:15.036 --> 08:17.371
I saw everything in Sinwol-dong.

08:18.414 --> 08:20.124
So don't be sneaky and answer me.

08:20.875 --> 08:21.876
How much do you know?

08:21.959 --> 08:23.294
Goddamn it!

08:25.087 --> 08:26.547
No, that's not it.

08:26.631 --> 08:28.049
You should be denying it!

08:28.132 --> 08:29.967
How much do you know?

08:31.135 --> 08:32.386
Because of you,

08:32.887 --> 08:35.097
I was prepared to kill someone.

08:35.723 --> 08:39.268
Because of you, I even sold my body
to a woman older than my mom.

08:39.352 --> 08:40.311
But you… Damn it!

08:40.394 --> 08:41.896
You use that to threaten me?

08:42.980 --> 08:44.440
Seriously.

08:47.902 --> 08:49.946
Why is everyone doing this to me today?

08:50.655 --> 08:51.781
You should deny it.

08:51.864 --> 08:54.075
Would you believe me if I did?

08:55.117 --> 08:57.495
If I weren't a businesswoman or a whale,

08:58.663 --> 09:00.248
you never would've looked my way.

09:01.165 --> 09:03.793
If I hadn't been Kim Eun-jae or Sarah Kim,

09:05.378 --> 09:07.213
would you have stolen my car keys?

09:09.382 --> 09:11.217
So I made you this way?

09:12.718 --> 09:14.345
Is that what you're saying?

09:16.973 --> 09:18.182
What I'm saying is…

09:20.768 --> 09:22.853
if you hadn't been materialistic,

09:23.354 --> 09:25.022
would I have deceived you?

09:27.567 --> 09:29.443
So the person who made you this way

09:30.278 --> 09:31.445
is you.

09:33.364 --> 09:34.824
What will make you stop?

09:34.907 --> 09:36.367
Will you stop if I expose everything?

09:36.450 --> 09:38.035
Can you even do that?

09:38.911 --> 09:41.080
You're finished too
if Choi Chae-u finds out.

09:41.581 --> 09:43.499
You'll regret it if you go now.

09:43.583 --> 09:45.876
Then I wouldn't have even started.

09:52.592 --> 09:55.052
Everyone thinks we're strangers.

09:57.054 --> 09:59.265
So you don't know anything.

10:07.940 --> 10:09.442
Chairwoman, when did you arrive?

10:10.151 --> 10:11.027
Just now.

10:11.110 --> 10:13.613
If I'd known,
I would've come to greet you.

10:13.696 --> 10:14.614
By the way,

10:16.198 --> 10:18.534
did you really think I wouldn't know?

10:19.368 --> 10:20.995
Kang Ji-hwon told me

10:21.495 --> 10:24.707
that you two were in cahoots,
plotting to get one over on me.

10:25.207 --> 10:28.252
I only met him a few times
to learn more about you.

10:28.753 --> 10:31.964
I overstepped trying to get
more favorable contract terms.

10:32.048 --> 10:32.882
I'm sorry.

10:33.507 --> 10:34.884
Why are you apologizing?

10:34.967 --> 10:37.553
You're the one who was betrayed, not me.

10:46.937 --> 10:48.981
Kang Ji-hwon may be on my side now,

10:49.065 --> 10:51.651
but you will pay
for planting a mole on me.

10:51.734 --> 10:53.486
I want a 30% commission.

10:55.071 --> 10:56.822
That is Samwol's final offer.

10:58.032 --> 10:59.825
Would you give me some time

11:01.035 --> 11:02.078
to think it over?

11:02.161 --> 11:04.622
You have until the end of the party.

11:06.082 --> 11:08.709
After Choi got wind of your ties
with Kang Ji-hwon,

11:08.793 --> 11:11.003
she bulldozed the contract
for personal revenge.

11:11.504 --> 11:13.964
She likely didn't want anyone
to find out the truth.

11:15.508 --> 11:20.346
Admitting defeat would be more humiliating
than the damage to the department store.

11:20.846 --> 11:22.139
What do you think?

11:22.973 --> 11:24.558
Isn't this more convincing

11:25.059 --> 11:26.602
than Choi Chae-u's statement?

11:29.271 --> 11:30.481
I wouldn't know.

11:32.316 --> 11:33.859
I see you don't remember.

11:37.405 --> 11:39.490
Screw you!

11:39.990 --> 11:42.326
I hope you crash and burn!

11:42.410 --> 11:44.620
Go fuck yourself, moron! Fucking shit!

11:44.704 --> 11:46.205
- Fuck!
- What are you doing?

11:56.632 --> 11:59.385
Excuse me. Please wait inside.

12:03.139 --> 12:04.682
HOPE YOU CRASH AND BURN

12:04.765 --> 12:06.392
Please enter in an orderly fashion.

12:06.934 --> 12:09.687
We'd appreciate it
if you could wait upstairs.

12:14.734 --> 12:16.485
"Who would've done this?"

12:16.569 --> 12:18.654
No matter how hard you tried,
you had no idea.

12:19.280 --> 12:22.908
You had too many faces
going through your mind.

12:46.098 --> 12:47.767
Hello.

12:49.477 --> 12:53.564
And finally, you would've had to face
the one you least wanted to recall.

13:03.783 --> 13:05.576
Desperation.

13:07.745 --> 13:10.873
Fuck.

13:28.182 --> 13:29.266
And then?

13:29.809 --> 13:30.935
What happened next?

13:34.814 --> 13:36.315
You have no way of knowing.

13:37.149 --> 13:39.235
Only I know what went on in there.

13:39.318 --> 13:40.152
No.

13:40.236 --> 13:42.446
There was one more person there.

13:44.949 --> 13:46.492
The victim, Kim Mi-jeong.

13:47.827 --> 13:50.955
The autopsy is
the victim's final statement.

13:51.455 --> 13:53.165
The victim had a weapon with her,

13:53.666 --> 13:55.960
most likely a tool she was familiar with.

14:39.461 --> 14:41.797
The victim may have planned the murder,

14:41.881 --> 14:44.758
but you had just as much murderous intent.

14:48.262 --> 14:49.847
You had no hesitation

14:50.347 --> 14:52.516
as you struck her face many times.

14:56.228 --> 14:57.062
Take a good look

14:58.230 --> 15:00.524
at what you've done.

15:35.643 --> 15:39.647
You then quickly made a plan
to hide the body,

15:41.273 --> 15:45.110
one that you couldn't execute on your own.

15:46.612 --> 15:49.198
You needed someone
to handle everything for you.

15:49.281 --> 15:53.160
You knew from experience that Choi Chae-u…

15:55.245 --> 15:57.748
could make things seem
like they never happened.

15:58.582 --> 15:59.458
Your answer?

16:00.167 --> 16:01.168
I'll sign.

16:02.169 --> 16:04.755
I knew you would,
so I had the construction started.

16:05.422 --> 16:08.258
I can't leave the luxury space vacant.
Move in this month.

16:09.134 --> 16:11.303
I think I'll start today.

16:12.137 --> 16:13.722
- Come here.
- Lift it.

16:13.806 --> 16:15.391
Why aren't you coming?

16:16.475 --> 16:17.351
Hurry up.

16:17.851 --> 16:19.353
- These too, sir.
- Coming.

16:41.291 --> 16:44.878
Are these going
to the Boudoir flagship store too?

16:45.713 --> 16:47.006
To Samwol Department Store.

16:47.089 --> 16:48.007
- Okay.
- And you knew.

16:48.090 --> 16:50.843
Knew a place
where the body wouldn't be found.

17:05.816 --> 17:09.194
Once inside Samwol,
things would've been easy.

17:10.029 --> 17:12.740
You knew that place
like the back of your hand.

18:20.099 --> 18:22.935
You believed
it would be the perfect crime.

18:32.069 --> 18:33.320
But at the time,

18:34.154 --> 18:36.615
the victim was still alive.

18:37.741 --> 18:40.702
Hello and welcome.

18:41.203 --> 18:44.456
We sincerely thank our customers

18:44.540 --> 18:46.542
for visiting
Samwol Department Store today.

19:12.860 --> 19:14.069
Following the light,

19:14.778 --> 19:16.905
she crawled through the dirty sewer.

19:19.867 --> 19:23.996
We lifted hundreds of the victim's prints
from the sewer walls.

19:24.872 --> 19:28.083
It's proof that she struggled to survive
until the end.

19:36.842 --> 19:38.594
But by the time she was discovered,

19:40.387 --> 19:41.638
it was already too late.

19:43.515 --> 19:44.349
You knew

19:44.850 --> 19:47.644
that the victim was still alive
at the time.

19:48.145 --> 19:49.146
But even so…

19:54.443 --> 20:00.157
HYEON JAE-HYEON, VIOLENT CRIMES TEAM 1

20:11.960 --> 20:13.879
Once the analysis results come in,

20:14.630 --> 20:15.756
there's no going back.

20:18.217 --> 20:20.302
You can't reduce your sentence after that.

20:22.304 --> 20:23.764
I suggest you give up.

20:28.227 --> 20:30.479
What's left for me to give up?

20:35.734 --> 20:37.611
I've come too far.

20:51.250 --> 20:52.334
How did it go?

20:53.168 --> 20:54.544
She got to it first.

20:55.045 --> 20:56.338
The tissue sample is gone.

21:03.553 --> 21:04.554
But who could've…

21:26.076 --> 21:27.703
I've won in the end.

21:30.080 --> 21:32.207
Your reasoning was logical.

21:32.874 --> 21:34.835
But the truth is not like that.

21:35.794 --> 21:38.630
It's hard to take in,
and it doesn't make sense.

21:43.593 --> 21:45.512
I know this isn't easy for you,

21:46.305 --> 21:48.974
but what I'm about to tell you
is the truth.

21:56.148 --> 21:57.566
Have you gone mad?

21:58.066 --> 21:59.735
How did you know to come here?

21:59.818 --> 22:01.570
Am I not allowed to be here?

22:02.571 --> 22:06.033
Others may not know, but you do.

22:07.701 --> 22:08.785
Boudoir.

22:10.746 --> 22:12.706
I made it with my own hands.

22:12.789 --> 22:15.459
I made all this happen.

22:19.004 --> 22:22.257
You have no idea
what I've had to sacrifice to get here.

22:23.925 --> 22:26.178
What the hell do you think you've done?

22:26.887 --> 22:28.680
Stay here until the party ends.

22:29.181 --> 22:30.974
I don't know what I'll do if you go on.

22:32.601 --> 22:35.187
You said I reminded you
of someone you know.

22:36.188 --> 22:37.522
You meant you, didn't you?

22:40.484 --> 22:41.902
Looks like I'm right.

22:45.739 --> 22:48.283
Then why the hell are you acting all holy?

22:55.624 --> 22:57.667
What are you gonna do with that?

22:58.960 --> 23:00.837
Are you going to kill me?

23:01.713 --> 23:03.673
You become me,

23:05.467 --> 23:07.761
and I become you now.

23:08.261 --> 23:09.262
Damn.

23:10.013 --> 23:11.848
Now you're the only one

23:13.350 --> 23:15.602
who knows that I'm Kim Mi-jeong.

23:16.770 --> 23:18.480
Stop talking crazy.

23:18.980 --> 23:20.690
They have security cameras all over.

23:22.359 --> 23:24.903
They haven't been working for a while now.

23:24.986 --> 23:26.696
Haven't you noticed?

23:27.197 --> 23:30.117
I sent all the factory workers
back to their countries,

23:31.368 --> 23:35.038
and I had a hard time
making that place clean of any prints.

23:38.500 --> 23:41.420
Hundreds of people just outside that door
know who I am.

23:42.671 --> 23:47.050
Do any of those people truly know you?

23:48.009 --> 23:52.222
Would anyone even look for you
if you went missing?

23:56.726 --> 23:59.521
Try desperately as you might,
a fake is still a fake.

24:02.357 --> 24:04.443
If you can't tell the fake from the real,

24:04.943 --> 24:06.736
is it really fake?

24:26.089 --> 24:27.090
Ms. Kim,

24:27.591 --> 24:29.968
I'm not trying to be you

24:30.510 --> 24:32.179
because I'm a fake.

24:32.262 --> 24:34.389
It's possible because you're a fake.

24:54.784 --> 24:57.078
What do you know about me
to run your mouth?

24:57.579 --> 24:59.706
It wasn't my intention to kill her.

25:00.207 --> 25:03.043
If Sarah Kim had just apologized to me…

25:05.045 --> 25:07.297
things wouldn't have gotten
this out of hand.

25:11.927 --> 25:13.386
"I'm sorry."

25:16.806 --> 25:19.184
She refused to say those words
until the end.

25:43.250 --> 25:45.210
Please help me. Someone's been…

25:46.545 --> 25:49.130
Please help me. There's someone…

25:51.633 --> 25:52.592
Kim Eun-jae.

26:06.106 --> 26:07.148
Eun-jae.

26:32.841 --> 26:34.676
You've got the wrong person.

27:04.748 --> 27:07.208
If you can't tell the fake from the real,

27:08.335 --> 27:10.003
is it really fake?

27:26.227 --> 27:28.271
Sarah Kim didn't know how to stop.

27:30.440 --> 27:32.192
That's why she died.

27:34.110 --> 27:35.070
Damn it.

27:35.153 --> 27:37.614
Do you truly believe
you can be Kim Mi-jeong?

27:37.697 --> 27:38.948
I have faith in you.

27:40.367 --> 27:42.994
You won't let me be released like this.

27:47.457 --> 27:49.793
I confessed everything as Kim Mi-jeong.

27:50.293 --> 27:54.130
I will retract all confessions
and deny all charges as Sarah Kim.

27:59.719 --> 28:01.513
It's up to you now, Detective.

28:04.182 --> 28:05.141
What's your plan?

28:05.225 --> 28:08.061
It's not just your ass at stake here.
It's everyone else's too.

28:12.774 --> 28:13.608
It's your call.

28:13.692 --> 28:17.404
The suspect's confession aligns
with the entire investigation.

28:17.904 --> 28:21.116
She has admitted to the motive
and all aspects of the murder.

28:21.616 --> 28:24.244
Some facts were distorted,
but they weren't false.

28:24.744 --> 28:27.414
She's the culprit, whoever she might be.

28:27.497 --> 28:29.874
- Yeah.
- She's also not Kim Mi-jeong.

28:30.709 --> 28:34.170
Even if we release her now,
we can verify her identity and apply--

28:34.254 --> 28:38.007
How the hell will you verify her identity
when she has none?

28:40.051 --> 28:41.678
Unbelievable.

28:48.309 --> 28:49.144
Damn.

28:52.856 --> 28:54.023
It's six o'clock.

29:26.222 --> 29:27.974
It's up to you now, Detective.

29:28.558 --> 29:31.269
Will you release me as an innocent person…

29:33.271 --> 29:35.690
or lock me up as Kim Mi-jeong?

29:36.274 --> 29:39.569
REQUEST FOR WARRANT
NAME

29:46.493 --> 29:47.911
NAME

29:49.621 --> 29:53.958
KIM MI-JEONG

30:06.429 --> 30:08.223
Do you have a different hat?

30:17.440 --> 30:18.441
Let's go.

30:19.275 --> 30:21.194
- They're coming out!
- They're here.

30:21.694 --> 30:24.489
- Say a few words.
- Anything to say to the victim?

30:24.572 --> 30:26.199
How does it feel right now?

30:26.282 --> 30:28.368
Was there any coercive investigation?

30:36.125 --> 30:39.796
Given the meticulous planning
of the murder before the act

30:39.879 --> 30:45.260
and the willful abandonment of the victim
in a life-threatening situation,

30:45.760 --> 30:49.639
the defendant must face punishment
equal in severity to her crimes.

30:50.139 --> 30:53.268
Considering these
and other sentencing factors,

30:53.351 --> 30:55.770
the sentence is imposed as ordered.

30:56.312 --> 30:59.941
The defendant, Kim Mi-jeong,
is sentenced to ten years in prison.

31:13.746 --> 31:15.331
It's hot.

31:20.753 --> 31:24.507
"Inspector Park Mu-gyeong
of the Regional Investigation Division."

31:24.591 --> 31:27.886
"In recognition of your exemplary service
as a Korean police officer,

31:27.969 --> 31:29.721
we present this commendation."

31:29.804 --> 31:33.558
"Presented by Commissioner Kim Ki-chul
of the Seoul Metropolitan Police

31:33.641 --> 31:35.184
on August 5, 2024."

31:44.777 --> 31:45.612
Salute.

31:58.833 --> 32:00.126
Sir.

32:02.629 --> 32:04.380
I should call you chief now.

32:04.964 --> 32:07.759
- I'm told you opted for patrol unit work.
- You saw that?

32:07.842 --> 32:09.469
- I was going to tell you.
- Hey.

32:10.678 --> 32:12.805
I'm busting my ass to stay here.

32:13.306 --> 32:14.390
Why go there?

32:15.725 --> 32:18.269
I just think it'll be fun.

32:19.562 --> 32:20.396
Okay.

32:22.565 --> 32:23.399
Go.

32:23.483 --> 32:24.317
Yes, sir.

32:34.577 --> 32:35.662
"Fun"?

32:38.122 --> 32:40.041
Dogs are sensitive,

32:40.124 --> 32:43.336
so hold firmly like this and cut gently.

32:48.174 --> 32:50.677
2389. Visitor.

32:52.053 --> 32:54.889
I thought you said
you had no one to visit you.

33:12.115 --> 33:13.574
2389.

33:20.581 --> 33:22.125
How is life here?

33:22.875 --> 33:24.627
You came here to ask me that?

33:25.336 --> 33:26.212
No.

33:28.006 --> 33:29.841
I came to tell you what happened.

33:33.636 --> 33:36.806
Sarah Kim's funeral was conducted
as a Jane Doe's.

33:38.141 --> 33:39.892
DECEASED JANE DOE

33:39.976 --> 33:41.310
And Boudoir

33:42.437 --> 33:44.230
is as successful as ever.

33:48.943 --> 33:50.528
Even without me?

33:52.238 --> 33:53.239
Yes.

33:54.282 --> 33:55.408
That's a relief.

34:01.664 --> 34:05.376
How does it feel to have pulled off a con
against the world?

34:07.754 --> 34:09.672
You got promoted for capturing me,

34:09.756 --> 34:11.632
I was able to protect Boudoir,

34:12.258 --> 34:14.802
and Kim Mi-jeong became Sarah Kim,
just as she wanted.

34:16.971 --> 34:19.348
There are no victims,
so how is this a con?

34:25.354 --> 34:26.397
So,

34:27.440 --> 34:28.691
are you satisfied now?

34:32.612 --> 34:34.989
The only satisfaction in this world

34:35.823 --> 34:38.117
is the word "satisfaction."

34:41.120 --> 34:43.289
I have one last question for you.

34:44.290 --> 34:46.959
It's the easiest question in the world.

34:48.211 --> 34:50.213
The answer is also simple and concise.

34:57.386 --> 34:58.554
What is your name?

35:08.147 --> 35:09.816
THE ART OF SARAH

37:10.186 --> 37:15.191
Subtitle translation by: Yung Un Choi
